+"""Actual H1/PG16 -> private Unix bridge -> pinned PACSNode acceptance.
+
+Linux disposable CI only. No external identity provider or medical data. The
+archive runs in a new loopback-only network namespace; no PACS TCP port is
+published on the API/client host. Fixed-route bridge uses a service-only token.
+"""
